OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	The Shattered Ring
Description	Two keepers and a broken vault of heroes between them. Half turn symmetric. 2 players. A hero company holds twin keeps in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

